BT /F1 9.6 Tf 72.00 605.75 Td (\225) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 80.01 605.75 Td (In CAP-availability we ignore latency and say that every request will recieve a response right, it doesn\222t) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 80.01 592.35 Td (care if it takes a 100ms or even a minute. So we are ignoring customer experience here even though it\222s) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 80.01 578.95 Td (available.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 563.05 Td (And in practice we deal more with latency and partial failures more than full network partition right \(because of) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 549.65 Td (modern hardware and well designed systems\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 529.75 Td (This is where PACELC comes in:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 509.85 Td (If partition occurs -> choose between availability and consistency.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 489.95 Td (If no partition -> choose between consistency and latency.) Tj ET
