BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 447.58 Td (The literal meaning of pessimistic is \223believing that bad things will happen\224.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 427.68 Td (Pessimistic concurrency control assumes that conflicts between transactions are likely. So, before a transaction) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 414.28 Td (performs operations on data, it acquires locks to prevent other transactions from accessing the same data in a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 400.88 Td (conflicting way.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 380.98 Td (In simple terms, it follows this idea:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 361.08 Td (since conflicts are likely, prevent them upfront instead of detecting them later.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 341.18 Td (If a transaction wants to read data, it may acquire a shared lock. If a transaction wants to modify data, it acquires) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 327.78 Td (an exclusive lock.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 307.88 Td (This means:) Tj ET
