BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 268.08 Td (But once a transaction acquires an exclusive lock on a resource, other transactions must wait before they can) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 254.68 Td (read or write that same resource) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 234.78 Td (So pessimistic concurrency control avoids concurrency anomalies and other conflicting operations by making) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 221.38 Td (transactions wait until the current lock is released.) Tj ET
