BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 624.00 Td (Proxy is nothing but a machine that sits between 2 systems. A proxy terminates the incoming connection and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 610.60 Td (initiates a new, separate connection to the destination.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 590.70 Td (It acts like an intermediate layer that can:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 570.80 Td (apply rules \(allow/block\),) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 550.90 Td (route traffic,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 531.00 Td (hide details of the other side,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 511.10 Td (and make communication more controlled and predictable.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 491.20 Td (Common misconception is that it can be only between a client and a backend servers, but it can also be) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 477.80 Td (between 2 backend servers too.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 457.90 Td (Depending upon the kind of proxy that we are using in our system, it will have different applications:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 438.00 Td (Forward Proxy: This type of proxy is used to protect the clients accessing the websites via the internet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 418.10 Td (Reverse Proxy: This type of proxy is used to guard the web servers from the clients trying to access websites via) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 404.70 Td (the internet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 384.80 Td (Let\222s understand about each of them in depth.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 58.00 351.90 Td (Forward Proxy \(Client-Side Proxy\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 331.30 Td (Forward Proxy \(also called a client-side proxy or internet-facing proxy\) sits between the client and the internet) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 317.90 Td (\(for example, between your browser and a website\). So whenever your browser makes a request, it sends \(in) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 304.50 Td (plain text without encryption\) that request to the forward proxy first. The forward proxy can decide whether to) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 291.10 Td (allow it, block it, or route it to the correct destination server.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 271.20 Td (Then the destination server sends the response back to the forward proxy, and the forward proxy forwards that) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 257.80 Td (response back to your browser.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 237.90 Td (So the forward proxy\222s job is to act as a middleman for the client, it can hide the client\222s real identity \(IP\) from) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 224.50 Td (the internet and also control/log what the client is allowed to access.) Tj ET
