BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 404.22 Td (Advantages of Forward Proxy) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 384.32 Td (Content filtering and security : They can filter out unwanted or dangerous content. Proxies can block access to) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 370.92 Td (specific sites and protect the network by filtering out suspicious requests or malicious files before they reach the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 357.52 Td (user.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 337.62 Td (Anonymity: A forward proxy hides the client\222s IP address from the destination server. Since the server only sees) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 324.22 Td (the proxy\222s IP, it makes it much harder to track individual user activity or target specific clients for an attack.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 304.32 Td (Caching : Forward proxies cache frequently requested resources. When another requests the same data, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 290.92 Td (proxy serves it directly from its cache instead of fetching it from the internet. This reduces bandwidth usage and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 277.52 Td (speeds up load times.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 257.62 Td (Request Modification: Proxies can modify outgoing requests by adding or removing headers. \(can also group) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 244.22 Td (multiple requests as one\) This allows an organization to customize how traffic looks to the outside world or strip) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 230.82 Td (away sensitive information for better privacy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 210.92 Td (Access Control: They enforce strict rules on who can access the internet. By requiring authentication and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 197.52 Td (authorization, the proxy ensures that only permitted users or devices can reach external resources.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 177.62 Td (Real world example : I\222ve seen this in my universities and corporate office. All internet traffic is routed through a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 164.22 Td (proxy, so every request I make has to pass through that single checkpoint. If I try to access something that\222s) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 150.82 Td (blocked, say a restricted website, the proxy immediately detects it and cuts the connection based on predefined) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 137.42 Td (rules. This is how organizations, control what content is allowed within their networks.) Tj ET
