BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 704.90 Td (A load balancer \(as it splits traffic across servers, it abstracts out the number of servers are there what they do\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 691.50 Td (is a specialized reverse proxy for traffic distribution.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 671.60 Td (Db Proxies are specialized form of reverse proxy \(sits infront of databases. It abstracts the database layer,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 658.20 Td (handles connection pooling, and caches common query results.\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 638.30 Td (CDN \(Content Delivery Network\): A specialized, globally distributed reverse proxy. While a normal proxy sits in) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 624.90 Td (one data center, a CDN places edge proxies in hundreds of cities worldwide. It caches static content \(like) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 611.50 Td (images and videos\) as close to the user as possible to reduce latency.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 591.60 Td (Reverse Proxy can be all of these, but all of these cant be a reverse proxy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 571.70 Td (Industry-Standard Reverse Proxies: Nginx, HAProxy, Kong Gateway, ProxySQL,) Tj ET
