0.46 g
BT /F3 8.6 Tf 58.00 740.25 Td (2026-02-20 \267 distributed systems) Tj ET
0 g
0.55 g
BT /F1 7.6 Tf 58.00 724.75 Td (Source: Engineering notes \227 pradyumnac26.github.io) Tj ET
