BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 587.25 Td (When the frontend makes a request to the backend on a different origin, the browser decides how to handle it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 567.35 Td (Depending on how safe the request is CORS can take 2 flows:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 547.45 Td (1. Simple Request) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 527.55 Td (A simple request is one that the browser considers safe so it sends the request directly without asking for) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 514.15 Td (permission first.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 494.25 Td (This type of request should follow these rules.) Tj ET
q 479.00 0 0 365.42 58.00 103.93 cm /Im46 Do Q
