BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 778.00 Td (If the browser sees a non-simple or if it feels that a particular request is risky, it performs a preflight check before) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 764.60 Td (sending the real request.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 744.70 Td (This preflight is a small HTTP request sent using the OPTIONS method it\222s the browser\222s way of asking the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 731.30 Td (backend for permission first before performing the real action.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 711.40 Td (A preflight request happens when it satisfies one of the 3 conditions:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 72.00 691.50 Td (\225) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 80.01 691.50 Td (The method is not GET, POST, or HEAD , meaning mostly when it is PUT, DELETE, PATCH.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 72.00 675.60 Td (\225) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 80.01 675.60 Td (The request includes custom headers \(e.g., Authorization, X-Custom-Header\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 72.00 659.70 Td (\225) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 80.01 659.70 Td (The Content-Type is not one of the 3 simple types.) Tj ET
