BT /F1 9.6 Tf 72.00 411.75 Td (\225) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 80.01 411.75 Td (Method -> OPTIONS the browser is asking for permission.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 72.00 395.85 Td (\225) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 80.01 395.85 Td (Access-Control-Request-Method -> tells the server: \223I plan to make a PUT request.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 72.00 379.95 Td (\225) Tj ET
