BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 558.80 Td (There\222s a lot of math involved in this one, and if you are curious to learn on how to choose the optimal k and m,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 545.40 Td (you can check these 2 wonderful articles out \(usually u just use those formulaes directly, no need to remember) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 532.00 Td (them\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 100.00 512.10 Td (\225) Tj ET
