BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 435.10 Td (deletion. There are multiple variants of bloom filters, each of them has its own use case, you can always explore) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 421.70 Td (them..) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 72.00 401.80 Td (\225) Tj ET
