BT /F1 9.6 Tf 100.00 370.00 Td (\225) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 108.01 370.00 Td (A DB/Redis/disk lookup for \223NO\224 is expensive or happens at high QPS) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 100.00 354.10 Td (\225) Tj ET
