BT /F1 9.6 Tf 72.00 674.85 Td (\225) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 80.01 674.85 Td (multiple similar workers read from the same queue, but each message is picked up by only one worker.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 72.00 658.95 Td (\225) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 80.01 658.95 Td (Once a worker receives a message, SQS hides it for the visibility timeout period.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 72.00 643.05 Td (\225) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 80.01 643.05 Td (If the worker finishes, it deletes the message. If it fails or times out, the message becomes visible again for) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 80.01 629.65 Td (another worker to process.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 613.75 Td (This model works well when we want to distribute work across workers doing the same kind of job.) Tj ET
