BT /F1 9.6 Tf 80.01 465.05 Td (Send message to the messaging system) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 449.15 Td (It\222s no longer Atomic, meaning:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 72.00 429.25 Td (\225) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 80.01 429.25 Td (If message send fails after storage write -> orphaned blob) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 72.00 413.35 Td (\225) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 80.01 413.35 Td (If storage write fails but message sent to the messaging system -> broken reference) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 58.00 397.45 Td (So in production, it would become super important to implement this along with cautions like :) Tj ET
